# Repository Layer

## Contract

`src/repositories/bling.repository.interface.ts` defines `IBlingRepository` — the sole HTTP abstraction entities depend on.

### Verb Mapping (Laravel-style naming)

| Method | HTTP | Use in entities |
|--------|------|-----------------|
| `index` | GET (no resource id) | List, search, auxiliary GET routes |
| `show` | GET `endpoint/id` | Single resource or nested path via composite `id` |
| `store` | POST | Create, action endpoints that POST a body |
| `update` | PATCH `endpoint/id` | Partial updates, some situation changes |
| `replace` | PATCH `endpoint/id` | Full replacements (despite "replace" name; see `BlingRepository.replace`) |
| `destroy` | DELETE `endpoint/id` | Delete single or bulk (empty `id` + query params) |

### Options Shape

All calls accept an options object extending `IDefaultOptions` with:

- `endpoint` — path segment(s) without leading slash
- `params` — query parameters (`IDefaultParams`)
- `headers` — optional (`IDefaultHeaders`)
- `shouldIncludeHeadersInResponse` — merges response headers into return value (used in `src/entities/homologacao/index.ts`)

Body-bearing calls add `body`; id-bearing calls add `id` (string, may include sub-paths like `` `${idContato}/situacoes` ``).

## Implementation

`src/repositories/bling.repository.ts`:

- Creates an axios instance with `baseURL` from constructor props.
- Injects `Authorization: Bearer <accessToken>` via request interceptor.
- Maps axios responses to `response.data` (or data + headers when flagged).
- On failure: throws `BlingApiException` when Bling returns `IDefaultErrorResponse` (`src/entities/@shared/interfaces/error.interface.ts`); otherwise `BlingInternalException`.

## Test Double

`src/repositories/bling-in-memory.repository.ts` implements `IBlingRepository` for unit tests:

- Per-verb response setters (`setIndexResponse`, `setShowResponse`, etc.) and a global `setResponse` fallback.
- Ignores options; returns configured mocks.

## Rules for Changes

- Add new HTTP patterns only here — never in entity classes.
- Keep generic type parameters on repository methods when extending the interface.
- Preserve error mapping in `defaultCatchBehavior`; entities should not catch axios errors.
- If Bling uses PUT for an endpoint, confirm whether `update` or `replace` is correct by checking an existing similar entity (e.g. `src/entities/contatos/index.ts` uses `replace` for PUT-style updates).
